## Rounds 2-3: scripts/ci/workflowRunsCiRule.ts, each clause disabled alone, against tests/unit/ci/workflowRunsCiRule.test.ts (36 cases) at the round-3 head
The test file applies every bypass blind review found to the real ci.yml and package.json:
- if: false on the step or the job, a shell override, CI_SKIP_BUILD;
- an earlier or later extra step, or checkout swapped;
- a trigger removed, retargeted, path-filtered, or given branches [master, '!master'];
- a quoted continue-on-error, or a decoy job;
- package.json: a no-op ci, preci/postci/(pre|post)install/(pre|post)prepare hooks, or prepare repointed;
- an unknown runs-on label.
G0/G1 test run-ci.sh's bash no-bunfig gate.
